      "id": "t20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 101,
      "y": 411,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 168.8,
      "text": "SIDEBAR\n\n\u2022 [+ New chat]\n\u2022 Past conversations, grouped\nToday / Last 7 days / Older\n\u2022 Title (auto-named from turn 1)\n\u2022 Search \u00b7 rename \u00b7 archive \u00b7 delete\n\u2022 Active conversation highlighted\n\u2022 Infinite scroll, 20 per page",
      "originalText": "SIDEBAR\n\n\u2022 [+ New chat]\n\u2022 Past conversations, grouped\n  Today / Last 7 days / Older\n\u2022 Title (auto-named from turn 1)\n\u2022 Search \u00b7 rename \u00b7 archive \u00b7 delete\n\u2022 Active conversation highlighted\n\u2022 Infinite scroll, 20 per page",
