      "id": "t22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 461,
      "y": 411,
      "width": 758,
      "height": 112.5,
      "text": "MESSAGE STREAM\n\n\u2022 User + assistant turns, rendered from SSE\n\u2022 RECOMMENDATION CARDS \u2014 grape variety, taste profile, typical regions, example producers\n\u2022 Confidence chip per axis ('likely dry' is not 'dry') \u00b7 row-id citation per card\n\u2022 thumbs up / down per card \u00b7 'why it matches' in the user's own words",
      "originalText": "MESSAGE STREAM\n\n\u2022 User + assistant turns, rendered from SSE\n\u2022 RECOMMENDATION CARDS \u2014 grape variety, taste profile, typical regions, example producers\n\u2022 Confidence chip per axis ('likely dry' is not 'dry')  \u00b7  row-id citation per card\n\u2022 thumbs up / down per card  \u00b7  'why it matches' in the user's own words",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b21",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
