      "width": 758,
      "height": 112.5,
      "text": "PROMPT BAR\n\n\u2022 Free-text input (textarea, Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a newline)\n\u2022 QUICK-REPLY CHIPS \u2014 option buttons emitted by the interview step, so the novice never has to type\nwine words\n\u2022 Refine chips after results: less sweet \u00b7 lighter \u00b7 smoother \u00b7 less oaky",
      "originalText": "PROMPT BAR\n\n\u2022 Free-text input (textarea, Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a newline)\n\u2022 QUICK-REPLY CHIPS \u2014 option buttons emitted by the interview step, so the novice never has to type wine words\n\u2022 Refine chips after results: less sweet \u00b7 lighter \u00b7 smoother \u00b7 less oaky",
