      "width": 1118,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "ERROR & EMPTY STATES\nstream drop \u2192 resume at ?after={seq} \u00b7 no-match empty state (FR-13), never silently widened\nmodel/guard failure \u2192 templated copy from the row, never a stack trace (NFR-7)",
      "originalText": "ERROR & EMPTY STATES\nstream drop \u2192 resume at ?after={seq}  \u00b7  no-match empty state (FR-13), never silently widened\nmodel/guard failure \u2192 templated copy from the row, never a stack trace (NFR-7)",
