      "id": "l36",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 506.5,
      "height": 262.5,
      "text": "solid arrow        request / forward data flow\ndashed arrow     response, write-back, or build-time (offline) flow\ndiamond              LLM decision point\ndashed box         logical grouping or store boundary\n\nBands run 1 \u2192 4 top to bottom:\n   BAND 1   client \u00b7 back end \u00b7 orchestration \u00b7 model layer\n   BAND 2   the RAG pipeline, stage A \u2192 K\n   BAND 3   persistence & retrieval indexes\n   BAND 4   offline authoring \u2014 runs before anyone arrives\n\nEvery box in bands 1\u20133 is in the hot path of a single user turn.\nBand 4 runs at build time only; its output is a frozen,\nversion-pinned artifact committed to the repo.",
      "originalText": "solid arrow        request / forward data flow\ndashed arrow     response, write-back, or build-time (offline) flow\ndiamond              LLM decision point\ndashed box         logical grouping or store boundary\n\nBands run 1 \u2192 4 top to bottom:\n   BAND 1   client \u00b7 back end \u00b7 orchestration \u00b7 model layer\n   BAND 2   the RAG pipeline, stage A \u2192 K\n   BAND 3   persistence & retrieval indexes\n   BAND 4   offline authoring \u2014 runs before anyone arrives\n\nEvery box in bands 1\u20133 is in the hot path of a single user turn.\nBand 4 runs at build time only; its output is a frozen,\nversion-pinned artifact committed to the repo.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
