      "type": "text",
      "x": 1381,
      "y": 325.0,
      "width": 1418,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "MIDDLEWARE (outermost \u2192 innermost)\nCORS \u2192 session cookie \u2192 AGE-GATE GUARD \u2192 per-IP rate limit \u2192 idempotency \u2192 request-id \u2192 structured logging \u2192 exception shield",
      "originalText": "MIDDLEWARE  (outermost \u2192 innermost)\nCORS \u2192 session cookie \u2192 AGE-GATE GUARD \u2192 per-IP rate limit \u2192 idempotency \u2192 request-id \u2192 structured logging \u2192 exception shield",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b38",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
