      "id": "t43",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1381,
      "y": 1055.0,
      "width": 1418,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "SERVICE LAYER\nConversationService \u00b7 MessageService \u00b7 ProfileService \u00b7 FeedbackService \u00b7 TransactionLog \u00b7 SseEventBus\nOwns transactions, ordering (seq), idempotency and fan-out. Holds no prompts and no retrieval logic.",
      "originalText": "SERVICE LAYER\nConversationService \u00b7 MessageService \u00b7 ProfileService \u00b7 FeedbackService \u00b7 TransactionLog \u00b7 SseEventBus\nOwns transactions, ordering (seq), idempotency and fan-out. Holds no prompts and no retrieval logic.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b42",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
