      "id": "t45",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1381,
      "y": 1215.0,
      "width": 1418,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "REPOSITORY LAYER\nSQLAlchemy Core \u2192 SQLite (WAL). Typed row models; Pydantic schemas at every boundary.",
      "originalText": "REPOSITORY LAYER\nSQLAlchemy Core \u2192 SQLite (WAL).  Typed row models; Pydantic schemas at every boundary.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b44",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 7081,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7082,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "t47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "b46",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1370,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 470
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7083,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7084,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t47",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1381,
      "y": 1341,
      "width": 1418,
      "height": 245.0,
      "text": "SQLite (WAL) \u2014 CONVERSATION & TRANSACTION STORE\n\nconversation (id, user_id, title, created_at, updated_at, archived_at, dataset_version)\nmessage (id, conversation_id, role, seq, turn_id, created_at) UNIQUE(conversation_id, seq)\nmessage_part (id, message_id, kind, text, card_json, row_id, citation_json) kind: text|card|chips|error\ntaste_profile (conversation_id, style, sweetness, body, oak, tannin, acidity, fruit_savoury, confidence_json)\nfeedback (id, message_id, row_id, vote, created_at)\ntransaction_log (id, conversation_id, turn_id, intent, intent_confidence, model, tokens_in, tokens_out,\ncost_usd, latency_ms, status, error_code)\nretrieval_log (id, turn_id, stage, query_text, candidate_row_ids, ranks, scores)\ngraph_checkpoint (turn_id, node, state_json, created_at)\n\nidx: conversation(user_id, updated_at DESC) \u00b7 message(conversation_id, seq) \u00b7 transaction_log(turn_id)\nAlembic migrations. Phase 2 \u2192 Postgres: same schema, swap the SQLAlchemy URL.",
      "originalText": "SQLite (WAL)  \u2014  CONVERSATION & TRANSACTION STORE\n\nconversation      (id, user_id, title, created_at, updated_at, archived_at, dataset_version)\nmessage           (id, conversation_id, role, seq, turn_id, created_at)   UNIQUE(conversation_id, seq)\nmessage_part      (id, message_id, kind, text, card_json, row_id, citation_json)   kind: text|card|chips|error\ntaste_profile     (conversation_id, style, sweetness, body, oak, tannin, acidity, fruit_savoury, confidence_json)\nfeedback          (id, message_id, row_id, vote, created_at)\ntransaction_log   (id, conversation_id, turn_id, intent, intent_confidence, model, tokens_in, tokens_out,\n                   cost_usd, latency_ms, status, error_code)\nretrieval_log     (id, turn_id, stage, query_text, candidate_row_ids, ranks, scores)\ngraph_checkpoint  (turn_id, node, state_json, created_at)\n\nidx: conversation(user_id, updated_at DESC) \u00b7 message(conversation_id, seq) \u00b7 transaction_log(turn_id)\nAlembic migrations.   Phase 2 \u2192 Postgres: same schema, swap the SQLAlchemy URL.",
