      "type": "text",
      "x": 3151,
      "y": 335.0,
      "width": 1438,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "TURN CONTEXT BUILDER\nLoads last N turns (windowed + rolling summary) \u00b7 filled taste-profile slots \u00b7 the previous result set and its row ids \u00b7 retrieved-document memory \u2192 GraphState",
      "originalText": "TURN CONTEXT BUILDER\nLoads last N turns (windowed + rolling summary) \u00b7 filled taste-profile slots \u00b7 the previous result set and its row ids \u00b7 retrieved-document memory  \u2192  GraphState",
