      "type": "text",
      "x": 3595,
      "y": 525.0,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 80.0,
      "text": "INTENT ROUTER (LLM)\nclassify(utterance, history, filled slots)\n\u2192 interview | recommend | refine | out_of_scope\nstructured output \u00b7 temperature 0 \u00b7 returns confidence",
      "originalText": "INTENT ROUTER  (LLM)\nclassify(utterance, history, filled slots)\n\u2192 interview | recommend | refine | out_of_scope\nstructured output \u00b7 temperature 0 \u00b7 returns confidence",
