      "id": "t56",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3151,
      "y": 790.0,
      "width": 1438,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "1 \u00b7 INTERVIEW WORKFLOW\nSlots unfilled \u2192 ask, never guess. Picks the NEXT MOST-DISCRIMINATING question given what is already known (style gates which axes even apply), phrases it as a physical sensation\nrather than wine jargon, and emits option chips. Writes answers back into taste_profile. Hard cap: 3 questions.",
      "originalText": "1 \u00b7 INTERVIEW  WORKFLOW\nSlots unfilled \u2192 ask, never guess. Picks the NEXT MOST-DISCRIMINATING question given what is already known (style gates which axes even apply), phrases it as a physical sensation rather than wine jargon, and emits option chips. Writes answers back into taste_profile. Hard cap: 3 questions.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b55",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
