      "id": "t58",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3151,
      "y": 1020.0,
      "width": 1438,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "2 \u00b7 RECOMMEND WORKFLOW\nSlots sufficient \u2192 hands the profile and utterance to the RAG pipeline in BAND 2, then ranks, diversifies across grape variety and assembles 3\u20135 grounded cards. Each card carries\nits row id, its per-axis confidence and a 'why it matches' line in the user's own words.",
      "originalText": "2 \u00b7 RECOMMEND  WORKFLOW\nSlots sufficient \u2192 hands the profile and utterance to the RAG pipeline in BAND 2, then ranks, diversifies across grape variety and assembles 3\u20135 grounded cards. Each card carries its row id, its per-axis confidence and a 'why it matches' line in the user's own words.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b57",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 7107,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7108,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
