      "id": "t64",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3151,
      "y": 1635.0,
      "width": 1438,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "GROUNDING GUARD\nEvery assertion must resolve to a dataset row id. Unsourced spans are dropped; a card that loses its source is replaced by templated copy from the row. No invented bottle leaves\nthis lane.",
      "originalText": "GROUNDING GUARD\nEvery assertion must resolve to a dataset row id. Unsourced spans are dropped; a card that loses its source is replaced by templated copy from the row. No invented bottle leaves this lane.",
