      "id": "t66",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3151,
      "y": 1795.0,
      "width": 1438,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "RESPONSE ASSEMBLER \u2192 SSE\nEmits ordered events: token (streamed prose) \u00b7 card \u00b7 chips \u00b7 citation \u00b7 usage \u00b7 done | error.\nWrites message + message_part rows as it goes, so a dropped stream can resume at ?after={seq}.",
      "originalText": "RESPONSE ASSEMBLER  \u2192  SSE\nEmits ordered events: token (streamed prose) \u00b7 card \u00b7 chips \u00b7 citation \u00b7 usage \u00b7 done | error.\nWrites message + message_part rows as it goes, so a dropped stream can resume at ?after={seq}.",
      "fontSize": 16,
