      "text": "MODEL GATEWAY / LLM CLIENT\nAnthropic SDK \u00b7 per-call timeout + bounded retry \u00b7 circuit breaker \u00b7 token & cost accounting\nprompt-cache prefixes \u00b7 structured outputs \u00b7 streaming \u00b7 one place to swap a model",
      "originalText": "MODEL GATEWAY  /  LLM CLIENT\nAnthropic SDK \u00b7 per-call timeout + bounded retry \u00b7 circuit breaker \u00b7 token & cost accounting\nprompt-cache prefixes \u00b7 structured outputs \u00b7 streaming \u00b7 one place to swap a model",
