      "width": 1578,
      "height": 60.0,
      "text": "MODEL-SIDE GUARDRAILS\nStructured outputs on router and slot extraction, so parsing is never a failure mode. Retrieved text is passed as data, never as instructions. Producer names are passed through verbatim from the\nrow \u2014 the model is forbidden from naming a producer.",
      "originalText": "MODEL-SIDE GUARDRAILS\nStructured outputs on router and slot extraction, so parsing is never a failure mode. Retrieved text is passed as data, never as instructions. Producer names are passed through verbatim from the row \u2014 the model is forbidden from naming a producer.",
