      "x": 4881,
      "y": 1861,
      "width": 1578,
      "height": 206.2,
      "text": "BRD AMENDMENT REQUIRED\n\nThis architecture reverses five decisions in BRD v1.1:\n\u00b7 \u00a75 / FR-10 / NFR-9 \u2014 a model now runs in the request path\n\u00b7 NFR-1 \u2014 p95 moves from <100 ms to roughly 2\u20134 s (streamed)\n\u00b7 NFR-4 \u2014 the runtime now needs an API key and outbound network\n\u00b7 \u00a79 \u2014 the vector store and embedding pipeline return\n\u00b7 \u00a73 / D5 \u2014 free text becomes a first-class input, not just chips\n\nThe grounding rules are NOT relaxed: retrieval-only answers, row-id\ncitation per claim, and no invented bottle (FR-11, \u00a78) all survive.",
      "originalText": "BRD AMENDMENT REQUIRED\n\nThis architecture reverses five decisions in BRD v1.1:\n\u00b7  \u00a75 / FR-10 / NFR-9  \u2014 a model now runs in the request path\n\u00b7  NFR-1  \u2014 p95 moves from <100 ms to roughly 2\u20134 s (streamed)\n\u00b7  NFR-4  \u2014 the runtime now needs an API key and outbound network\n\u00b7  \u00a79  \u2014 the vector store and embedding pipeline return\n\u00b7  \u00a73 / D5  \u2014 free text becomes a first-class input, not just chips\n\nThe grounding rules are NOT relaxed: retrieval-only answers, row-id\ncitation per claim, and no invented bottle (FR-11, \u00a78) all survive.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b90",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
