      "width": 966.0,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "BAND 2 \u00b7 AI LAYER \u2014 END-TO-END RAG PIPELINE   (stage A \u2192 K, left to right)",
      "originalText": "BAND 2 \u00b7 AI LAYER \u2014 END-TO-END RAG PIPELINE   (stage A \u2192 K, left to right)",
