      "id": "t96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 111,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 518,
      "height": 243.8,
      "text": "A \u00b7 QUERY REWRITER\nLLM \u00b7 model gateway\n\nIN: current utterance + last N turns + filled slots + previous result\nset.\n\nResolves ellipsis and coreference \u2014 the thing naive RAG gets wrong:\n\n\"something lighter than that\"\n\u2192 \"light-bodied dry red, soft tannins, similar to Malbec\"\n\nOUT: one standalone, self-contained query. The conversation never\nreaches the retriever raw.",
      "originalText": "A \u00b7 QUERY REWRITER\nLLM \u00b7 model gateway\n\nIN: current utterance + last N turns + filled slots + previous result set.\n\nResolves ellipsis and coreference \u2014 the thing naive RAG gets wrong:\n\n\"something lighter than that\"\n\u2192 \"light-bodied dry red, soft tannins, similar to Malbec\"\n\nOUT: one standalone, self-contained query. The conversation never reaches the retriever raw.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b95",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
