      "id": "t98",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 693,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 518,
      "height": 187.5,
      "text": "B \u00b7 DECOMPOSE\nLLM \u00b7 model gateway\n\nSplits a multi-intent ask into independent sub-queries:\n\n\"a red for steak and something sweet for after\"\n\u2192 two retrievals, two result groups.\n\nEach sub-query runs the rest of the pipeline on its own; results\nmerge at stage H.",
      "originalText": "B \u00b7 DECOMPOSE\nLLM \u00b7 model gateway\n\nSplits a multi-intent ask into independent sub-queries:\n\n\"a red for steak and something sweet for after\"\n\u2192 two retrievals, two result groups.\n\nEach sub-query runs the rest of the pipeline on its own; results merge at stage H.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b97",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
