      "id": "t100",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1275,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 518,
      "height": 206.2,
      "text": "C \u00b7 EXPAND (consumer \u2192 sommelier)\n\nThe translation layer the product exists for:\nsmooth \u2192 low tannin\nnot too sour \u2192 soft acidity\nbuttery \u2192 pronounced oak\njammy \u2192 fruit-forward\n\n+ HyDE: generate a pseudo tasting-note from the profile and embed\nTHAT, so the dense side matches note-to-note instead of\nquestion-to-note.",
      "originalText": "C \u00b7 EXPAND  (consumer \u2192 sommelier)\n\nThe translation layer the product exists for:\n  smooth        \u2192 low tannin\n  not too sour  \u2192 soft acidity\n  buttery       \u2192 pronounced oak\n  jammy         \u2192 fruit-forward\n\n+ HyDE: generate a pseudo tasting-note from the profile and embed THAT, so the dense side matches note-to-note instead of question-to-note.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b99",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
