      "id": "t102",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1857,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 478,
      "height": 225.0,
      "text": "D \u00b7 RETRIEVAL PLANNER\n\nTurns slots into filters:\nstyle \u2192 HARD pre-filter\nsweetness \u2192 band\nbody / oak \u2192 soft weight\n\nEmits SQL predicates applied INSIDE each retriever, not after \u2014\nso top-k is 50 relevant rows, not 50 rows then a filter that\nempties the list.\n\nSets k per retriever.",
      "originalText": "D \u00b7 RETRIEVAL PLANNER\n\nTurns slots into filters:\n  style      \u2192 HARD pre-filter\n  sweetness  \u2192 band\n  body / oak \u2192 soft weight\n\nEmits SQL predicates applied INSIDE each retriever, not after \u2014 so top-k is 50 relevant rows, not 50 rows then a filter that empties the list.\n\nSets k per retriever.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b101",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
