      "width": 518,
      "height": 52.5,
      "text": "E1 \u00b7 DENSE\nbi-encoder kNN over wine vectors \u00b7 cosine \u00b7 top-k 50\nCatches paraphrase and taste-adjacency.",
      "originalText": "E1 \u00b7 DENSE\nbi-encoder kNN over wine vectors \u00b7 cosine \u00b7 top-k 50\nCatches paraphrase and taste-adjacency.",
