      "type": "text",
      "x": 2451,
      "y": 2651.25,
      "width": 518,
      "height": 52.5,
      "text": "E2 \u00b7 SPARSE (BM25)\nSQLite FTS5 \u00b7 top-k 50\nCatches exact varietal, producer and region terms that embeddings blur.",
      "originalText": "E2 \u00b7 SPARSE  (BM25)\nSQLite FTS5 \u00b7 top-k 50\nCatches exact varietal, producer and region terms that embeddings blur.",
