      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7211,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7212,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t113",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3071,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 498,
      "height": 225.0,
      "text": "F \u00b7 FUSION\nReciprocal Rank Fusion\n\nRRF over the three ranked lists:\n\nscore(d) = sum of 1 / (k + rank_i(d))\nk = 60\n\nRank-based, so the three retrievers' incomparable score scales\nnever have to be normalised.\n\nDedupe by row_id \u2192 top 30 candidates.",
      "originalText": "F \u00b7 FUSION\nReciprocal Rank Fusion\n\nRRF over the three ranked lists:\n\n   score(d) = sum of  1 / (k + rank_i(d))\n   k = 60\n\nRank-based, so the three retrievers' incomparable score scales never have to be normalised.\n\nDedupe by row_id \u2192 top 30 candidates.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b112",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
