      "id": "t115",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3631,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 498,
      "height": 168.8,
      "text": "G \u00b7 CROSS-ENCODER RERANK\n\nScores each (query, candidate) pair JOINTLY rather than comparing\ntwo independent vectors.\n\n30 candidates \u2192 top 10 by true relevance.\n\nThis is the single biggest quality lever in the pipeline, and the\nstage naive RAG skips.",
      "originalText": "G \u00b7 CROSS-ENCODER RERANK\n\nScores each (query, candidate) pair JOINTLY rather than comparing two independent vectors.\n\n30 candidates \u2192 top 10 by true relevance.\n\nThis is the single biggest quality lever in the pipeline, and the stage naive RAG skips.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b114",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
