      "locked": false,
      "id": "t117",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4191,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 478,
      "height": 206.2,
      "text": "H \u00b7 MMR DIVERSIFY\n\nMaximal Marginal Relevance across GRAPE VARIETY.\n\nThree Cabernets, a Malbec and a Syrah teaches the user\nsomething; five Cabernets does not \u2014 and it hedges against one\nwrong inference.\n\nMerges sub-query groups from B.\n\n\u2192 3\u20135 final rows.",
      "originalText": "H \u00b7 MMR DIVERSIFY\n\nMaximal Marginal Relevance across GRAPE VARIETY.\n\nThree Cabernets, a Malbec and a Syrah teaches the user something; five Cabernets does not \u2014 and it hedges against one wrong inference.\n\nMerges sub-query groups from B.\n\n\u2192 3\u20135 final rows.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b116",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
