      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t119",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4731,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 478,
      "height": 262.5,
      "text": "I \u00b7 CONTEXT PACKER\n\nToken budget enforced. Near-duplicate rows collapsed. Ordered\nby score.\n\nEach row arrives at the model carrying:\nrow_id\n7 axes + per-axis confidence\ndescription\nregions \u00b7 producers\nreview_status\ndataset_version\n\nNothing else is in the prompt.",
      "originalText": "I \u00b7 CONTEXT PACKER\n\nToken budget enforced. Near-duplicate rows collapsed. Ordered by score.\n\nEach row arrives at the model carrying:\n  row_id\n  7 axes + per-axis confidence\n  description\n  regions \u00b7 producers\n  review_status\n  dataset_version\n\nNothing else is in the prompt.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b118",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
