      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t121",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5271,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 558,
      "height": 187.5,
      "text": "J \u00b7 GROUNDED GENERATOR\nLLM \u00b7 streamed\n\nWrites, per card:\n\u00b7 what it tastes like\n\u00b7 why it matches, in the user's own words\n\u00b7 an honest hedge where an axis is low-confidence\n\nCites row_id on every claim. Producer names are copied verbatim from the\nrow \u2014 never generated, because that is exactly what a model confabulates.",
      "originalText": "J \u00b7 GROUNDED GENERATOR\nLLM \u00b7 streamed\n\nWrites, per card:\n  \u00b7 what it tastes like\n  \u00b7 why it matches, in the user's own words\n  \u00b7 an honest hedge where an axis is low-confidence\n\nCites row_id on every claim. Producer names are copied verbatim from the row \u2014 never generated, because that is exactly what a model confabulates.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b120",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
