      "id": "t123",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5891,
      "y": 2461,
      "width": 558,
      "height": 168.8,
      "text": "K \u00b7 VERIFIER + EVAL TAP\n\nClaim \u2194 source check on the finished turn. Fail \u2192 one repair pass \u2192\ntemplated copy drawn straight from the row. Degrades, never invents.\n\nLogs query \u00b7 rewrite \u00b7 retrieved ids \u00b7 ranks \u00b7 chosen ids \u00b7 votes \u2192 the\nretrieval and intent eval sets.\n\nThen back to the orchestrator's grounding guard.",
      "originalText": "K \u00b7 VERIFIER  +  EVAL TAP\n\nClaim \u2194 source check on the finished turn. Fail \u2192 one repair pass \u2192 templated copy drawn straight from the row. Degrades, never invents.\n\nLogs query \u00b7 rewrite \u00b7 retrieved ids \u00b7 ranks \u00b7 chosen ids \u00b7 votes \u2192 the retrieval and intent eval sets.\n\nThen back to the orchestrator's grounding guard.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b122",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
