      "id": "t128",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 111,
      "y": 3171,
      "width": 1078,
      "height": 245.0,
      "text": "FROZEN WINE DATASET\nversioned artifact \u00b7 read-only at request time\n\nrow_id (stable, cited in every answer)\nstyle \u00b7 sweetness \u00b7 body \u00b7 tannin \u00b7 acidity \u00b7 fruit_savoury \u00b7 oak\nconfidence per axis\ndescription (the tasting note)\ntypical_regions[] \u00b7 example_producers[]\nreview_status \u00b7 reviewed_by \u00b7 reviewed_at\ndataset_version (pinned; served in /meta/dataset-version)\n\nProduced by BAND 4 and committed to the repo. The running app can\nread it and nothing else \u2014 this is what makes 'no invented bottle'\na structural property rather than a prompt instruction.",
      "originalText": "FROZEN WINE DATASET\nversioned artifact \u00b7 read-only at request time\n\nrow_id  (stable, cited in every answer)\nstyle \u00b7 sweetness \u00b7 body \u00b7 tannin \u00b7 acidity \u00b7 fruit_savoury \u00b7 oak\nconfidence per axis\ndescription  (the tasting note)\ntypical_regions[] \u00b7 example_producers[]\nreview_status \u00b7 reviewed_by \u00b7 reviewed_at\ndataset_version  (pinned; served in /meta/dataset-version)\n\nProduced by BAND 4 and committed to the repo. The running app can\nread it and nothing else \u2014 this is what makes 'no invented bottle'\na structural property rather than a prompt instruction.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b127",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
