      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1261,
      "y": 3171,
      "width": 1078,
      "height": 210.0,
      "text": "EVAL & FEEDBACK STORE\n\ngold_set (row_id, axis, true_value, labeller)\n~200 hand-labelled wines, over-sampling\nRiesling / Chenin / Moscato \u2014 the hard cases\n\nretrieval_eval (query, relevant_row_ids, recall@k, nDCG@10)\nintent_eval (utterance, true_intent, predicted, confidence)\nfeedback (row_id, vote, turn_id) \u2190 from band 1\n\nNothing consumes feedback yet. Logging it from day one means\npersonalisation starts with a dataset instead of starting with a wait.",
      "originalText": "EVAL & FEEDBACK STORE\n\ngold_set        (row_id, axis, true_value, labeller)\n                ~200 hand-labelled wines, over-sampling\n                Riesling / Chenin / Moscato \u2014 the hard cases\n\nretrieval_eval  (query, relevant_row_ids, recall@k, nDCG@10)\nintent_eval     (utterance, true_intent, predicted, confidence)\nfeedback        (row_id, vote, turn_id)   \u2190 from band 1\n\nNothing consumes feedback yet. Logging it from day one means\npersonalisation starts with a dataset instead of starting with a wait.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b129",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
