      "width": 580.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "text": "RETRIEVAL INDEXES  \u2014  built offline by band 4, read-only at request time",
      "originalText": "RETRIEVAL INDEXES  \u2014  built offline by band 4, read-only at request time",
