      "id": "t135",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2461,
      "y": 3236,
      "width": 598,
      "height": 157.5,
      "text": "VECTOR INDEX\n\u2190 read by E1\n\nsqlite-vec, or an in-memory NumPy matrix.\n\n384-d per row. At this corpus size a brute-force scan is single-digit milliseconds,\nso Phase 1 needs no vector database at all.\n\nRebuilt whenever dataset_version changes.",
      "originalText": "VECTOR INDEX\n\u2190 read by E1\n\nsqlite-vec, or an in-memory NumPy matrix.\n\n384-d per row. At this corpus size a brute-force scan is single-digit milliseconds, so Phase 1 needs no vector database at all.\n\nRebuilt whenever dataset_version changes.",
      "fontSize": 14,
