      "width": 598,
      "height": 140.0,
      "text": "FTS5 INDEX\n\u2190 read by E2\n\nSQLite full-text search over description + variety + winery + region.\n\nBM25 ranking, porter stemming.\n\nSame SQLite file as the dataset, so there is no second system to keep in sync.",
      "originalText": "FTS5 INDEX\n\u2190 read by E2\n\nSQLite full-text search over description + variety + winery + region.\n\nBM25 ranking, porter stemming.\n\nSame SQLite file as the dataset, so there is no second system to keep in sync.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
