      "height": 122.5,
      "text": "TASTE-AXIS TABLES\n\u2190 read by E3\n\nOne indexed column per axis plus its confidence.\n\nComposite index on (style, sweetness, body) \u2014 the three asked axes, so the hard\npre-filter is a single index seek.",
