      "id": "t152",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 111,
      "y": 3951,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 168.8,
      "text": "1 \u00b7 SOURCE\n\nEither (or both):\n\n\u00b7 ~150 variety-and-style rows drafted by a language model \u2014 small enough to review completely\n\n\u00b7 the winemag 130k tasting-note corpus, for the dense side\n\nThe choice is still open in the BRD; the pipeline accepts both and the row_id contract is identical.",
      "originalText": "1 \u00b7 SOURCE\n\nEither (or both):\n\n\u00b7 ~150 variety-and-style rows drafted by a language model \u2014 small enough to review completely\n\n\u00b7 the winemag 130k tasting-note corpus, for the dense side\n\nThe choice is still open in the BRD; the pipeline accepts both and the row_id contract is identical.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b151",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffdeeb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 7285,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7286,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "t154",
