      "locked": false,
      "id": "t154",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1183,
      "y": 3951,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 150.0,
      "text": "2 \u00b7 CLEAN + DEDUPE\n\n\u00b7 drop null variety / description\n\u00b7 collapse near-duplicate rows across vintages\n\u00b7 normalise variety spellings and the long tail\n\u00b7 carry `price` through unused, so Phase 3 is a flag rather than a re-run\n\nOutput is deterministic and checksummed.",
      "originalText": "2 \u00b7 CLEAN + DEDUPE\n\n\u00b7 drop null variety / description\n\u00b7 collapse near-duplicate rows across vintages\n\u00b7 normalise variety spellings and the long tail\n\u00b7 carry `price` through unused, so Phase 3 is a flag rather than a re-run\n\nOutput is deterministic and checksummed.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b153",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
