      "id": "t156",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2255,
      "y": 3951,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 112.5,
      "text": "3 \u00b7 TASTE-AXIS EXTRACTION\n\nBatch API (-50%) \u00b7 prompt-cached instruction prefix \u00b7 structured output pinned to the 7-axis schema, so parsing can never fail\nacross the corpus.\n\nEmits a CONFIDENCE per axis \u2014 nearly free here, and impossible to backfill without re-running the whole pass.",
      "originalText": "3 \u00b7 TASTE-AXIS EXTRACTION\n\nBatch API (-50%) \u00b7 prompt-cached instruction prefix \u00b7 structured output pinned to the 7-axis schema, so parsing can never fail across the corpus.\n\nEmits a CONFIDENCE per axis \u2014 nearly free here, and impossible to backfill without re-running the whole pass.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b155",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
