      "id": "t158",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3327,
      "y": 3951,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 150.0,
      "text": "4 \u00b7 VARIETAL PRIOR CROSS-CHECK\n\nCabernet is effectively always dry; Moscato and Port always sweet. A row contradicting a strong prior is an extraction artifact,\nnot a discovery.\n\nContradictions and low-confidence axes \u2192 the human review queue, not the index.\n\nMeasured against the gold set, per axis.",
      "originalText": "4 \u00b7 VARIETAL PRIOR CROSS-CHECK\n\nCabernet is effectively always dry; Moscato and Port always sweet. A row contradicting a strong prior is an extraction artifact, not a discovery.\n\nContradictions and low-confidence axes \u2192 the human review queue, not the index.\n\nMeasured against the gold set, per axis.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b157",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
