      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t162",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5471,
      "y": 3951,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 168.8,
      "text": "6 \u00b7 BUILD INDEXES\n\n\u00b7 embed every row \u2192 vector index\n\u00b7 rebuild the FTS5 index\n\u00b7 build the taste-axis composite index\n\u00b7 validate against the schema\n\u00b7 bump dataset_version\n\nA mismatch between the artifact and any index fails the build, so the two can never drift apart at request time.",
      "originalText": "6 \u00b7 BUILD INDEXES\n\n\u00b7 embed every row \u2192 vector index\n\u00b7 rebuild the FTS5 index\n\u00b7 build the taste-axis composite index\n\u00b7 validate against the schema\n\u00b7 bump dataset_version\n\nA mismatch between the artifact and any index fails the build, so the two can never drift apart at request time.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b161",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
